      },
      "content": "There are two gatekeepers to a research audience.\n(1) Did 3 random reviewers think your paper is good enough for ICLR?\n(2) What university are the authors at and how many followers do they have on X?\n\nLose peer review, and you're not losing gatekeepers. You're switching to gatekeeper #2.",
